# Third-party implementation-guide and reference material with unresolved upstream licensing
# (hl7-eu/oah declares none; decision recorded 2026-09-27, see docs/handoff/LEDGER.md and SOURCES.yaml).
# Regenerate locally with `oah-extract-ig` / `oah-verify-reference`; never redistribute from this repo.
# reference/CHECKSUMS.sha256 is this project's own hash manifest, not third-party content, and stays tracked.
ig/oah/
reference/*.zip
reference/*.pdf
.coverage

# Third-party presentations of the hackathon organisers (HL7 Europe, SYNYO, IEEE): no licence is stated, so they
